{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "stencil_1d_centered",
    "description": "A 1-D centered three-point stencil on 12 cells. The first makearray region covers every cell, so cell 1 reads u[0], an out-of-domain zero ghost; the later region overwrites cell 12 with a one-sided zero-gradient difference. Halo of u along x: (1, 1).",
